---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import Portfolio from '../components/Portfolio.astro';
---
<Site>
  <div class="shell" id="top">
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="home-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">Algebraic geometry · Higher categories</p><h1 id="home-title">Vihaan Dheer</h1><p class="affiliation">California Institute of Technology</p><p class="intro">Math PhD student at Caltech interested in algebraic geometry, higher category theory, and homotopy theory. Papers, expositions, and other notes in various fields can be found here.</p><div class="hero-links"><a class="text-link" href="#work">Explore my work ↓</a><a class="text-link" href="/resume.pdf">View résumé ↗︎</a></div></div><figure><img class="portrait" src="/profile.jpg" width="230" height="286" alt="Portrait of Vihaan Dheer" fetchpriority="high" /><figcaption>Mathematics at Caltech</figcaption></figure></section>
    <section class="blog-invitation" aria-labelledby="blog-invite"><div><p class="eyebrow">The blog</p><h2 id="blog-invite">Room for a smaller idea.</h2><p>Short and medium mathematical writing, alongside the longer notes.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/blog/">Visit the blog →</a></section>
    <Portfolio />
    <section id="about" class="rule-section about-grid" aria-labelledby="about-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">About</p><h2 id="about-title">Current interests</h2><p>Hi there! I'm currently working in algebraic geometry on problems related to enumerative geometry, derived categories, and mirror symmetry. Outside of this, I'm interested in higher category theory.</p><p>Most files are expository notes or surveys I've written while learning, and are often in progress.</p></div><div id="contact"><p class="eyebrow">Contact</p><h2>Let’s talk mathematics.</h2><p>Feel free to reach out with any comments or questions about math.</p><div class="contact-links"><a href="mailto:naahiv@caltech.edu">naahiv@caltech.edu</a><a href="/resume.pdf">Résumé ↗︎</a></div></div></section>
  </div>
</Site>
